WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.606
Whistleblower protection failure.

00:00:02.556 --> 00:00:05.181
The law that destroys whistleblowers.

00:00:05.181 --> 00:00:11.125
The Public Servants Disclosure Protection Act was designed to protect federal employees who report wrongdoing.

00:00:11.125 --> 00:00:13.681
In practice, it does the opposite.

00:00:13.681 --> 00:00:18.318
Zero successful prosecutions of those who retaliate against whistleblowers.

00:00:18.318 --> 00:00:22.999
The Public Sector Integrity Commissioner dismisses the vast majority of complaints.

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:29.034
Whistleblowers who report wrongdoing face demotion, termination, blacklisting, and career destruction.

00:00:29.034 --> 00:00:31.715
The wrongdoing they reported continues.

00:00:31.715 --> 00:00:35.749
The PSDPA does not protect whistleblowers from the system.

00:00:35.749 --> 00:00:38.545
It protects the system from whistleblowers.

00:00:38.545 --> 00:00:41.170
The pattern of whistleblower destruction.

00:00:41.170 --> 00:00:45.886
Three stages documented from tribunal records and PSIC reports.

00:00:45.886 --> 00:00:50.124
Why whistleblower protection failure matters for institutional capture.

00:00:50.124 --> 00:00:55.249
The chilling effect ensures that wrongdoing inside captured institutions goes unreported.

00:00:55.249 --> 00:00:59.011
Whistleblower failure completes the accountability architecture.

00:00:59.011 --> 00:01:03.727
The accountability scorecard shows ten oversight bodies that cannot enforce.

00:01:03.727 --> 00:01:06.886
Crown immunity shields the government from liability.

00:01:06.886 --> 00:01:10.772
Parliamentary privilege protects politicians from consequences.

00:01:10.772 --> 00:01:14.715
Regulatory capture ensures regulators serve industry.

00:01:14.715 --> 00:01:17.363
Media capture controls the narrative.

00:01:17.363 --> 00:01:23.693
And whistleblower protection failure ensures that insiders who could expose wrongdoing are destroyed rather than protected.

00:01:23.693 --> 00:01:27.306
Every accountability mechanism is captured or broken.

00:01:27.306 --> 00:01:33.261
The whistleblower is the last line of defence — and the PSDPA ensures that line is broken too.
